{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10282110","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10282110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1028211001:1":{"text":"바람... 바람이다! 내... 내 소환을 들었구나, 그렇지?","source_cn":"风……是风！你……你听到我的召唤了，对不对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E05F5F0FE07C582","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028211002:1":{"text":"정말 대단해! 미샤르테 님께서 정말 방랑자의 특성을 주셨어!","source_cn":"太棒了！弥萨忒真的赐予了我风语天赋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC99CEA41BFF8933B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028211003:1":{"text":"우리 엄마, 아빠한테 메시지를 좀 전해줄래? 그냥... 아, 내가 이제 바람과 대화할 수 있게 되었다고, 더 크면, 최고의...","source_cn":"请你传个信息给我的爸爸妈妈好不好？就说……对，就说我现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x040187CAF883ECB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028211004:1":{"text":"...음? 왜 바람이 점점 거세지는 거지? 바람아, 내 말을 좀 들어봐, 이렇게 흥분하지 말고...","source_cn":"……嗯？怎么风越来越大了，风啊，聆听我的话语，请你不要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C10DBE564E9B741","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028211005:1":{"text":"치피는 왜 바람 원소가 기분이 안 좋은 거 같죠...","source_cn":"满满怎么觉得风元素有点不太高兴……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x448220F6EF16693B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028211006:1":{"text":"큰일 났어, 바람의 언어를 아예 할 줄 몰라. 이런 식으로 “소통”하다간 바람 원소는 도발하고 있다고 느낄 거야!","source_cn":"糟了，他根本不会风语。这样“沟通”，风元素可能会觉得他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC338DC0DB92D9209","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028211007:1":{"text":"어떻게 된 거지... 내, 내 말을 좀 들어봐...","source_cn":"怎么回事……听我、听我说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF59359E25801F90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028211008:1":{"text":"오, 오지 마!!","source_cn":"别、别过来——！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB61BFF461B718087","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028211009:1":{"text":"큰일이야, 바람 원소가 폭주하려고 해! 어, 어서 막아야 해!","source_cn":"不好，风元素狂暴了！快、快阻止它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD09E1C7E16E18C83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:兰迪":{"text":"랜디","source":"兰迪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":3}}